    <h2>Cursor code review pre-merge checklist</h2>
    <ul class="article-checklist">
      <li>The pull request contract names affected interfaces, tests, and non-goals.</li>
      <li>Local Cursor review ran before push where it added useful feedback.</li>
      <li>The <code>Cursor Bugbot</code> conclusion and covered diff are known for the current pull-request head.</li>
      <li>Applicable root and nested <code>.cursor/BUGBOT.md</code> rules were present.</li>
      <li>Every consequential finding has exact repository evidence and a causal path.</li>
      <li>Every known blocker has an explicit current disposition.</li>
      <li>Required deterministic CI passed for the commit shown in GitHub's checks box.</li>
      <li>The repository-owned verdict names the reviewed SHA and usable review state.</li>
      <li>Required human approvals and unresolved human comments are satisfied.</li>
      <li>A maintainer still owns the final risk and merge decision.</li>
    </ul>
